# 🤖 AI Learning Mentor

An AI-powered learning mentor built using Python and Google Gemini AI.

## 📖 About

AI Learning Mentor helps students by generating:

- 🎯 Personalized Career Roadmap
- 📚 Learning Resources
- 💡 AI Project Suggestions
- 📄 Complete Learning Report
- 💾 Save Report as a Text File

---

## 🚀 Features

- Menu-driven interface
- Student profile analysis
- Google Gemini AI integration
- Typing animation
- Loading animation
- Response time measurement
- Report generation
- Save reports automatically

---

## 🛠 Technologies Used

- Python 3
- Google Gemini API
- python-dotenv

