## ⚙️ Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone <your-github-link>
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Create a `.env` file:

```text
GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_API_KEY
```

Run the project:

```bash
python main.py
```

